sequenceDiagram
    title First upload - proposed success sequence
    participant Browser
    participant Django
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant BlobStore
    Browser->>Django: POST uploads with client key
    Django->>PostgreSQL: Authorize and reserve quota
    PostgreSQL-->>Django: Upload UUID
    Django-->>Browser: Created upload session
    Browser->>Django: PUT content with attempt UUID
    Django->>PostgreSQL: Claim fenced attempt
    Django->>BlobStore: Stream and hash staging bytes
    Django->>PostgreSQL: Renew lease while streaming
    Django->>BlobStore: Verify and publish durably
    BlobStore-->>Django: Immutable object key
    Django->>PostgreSQL: Commit File and quota
    PostgreSQL-->>Django: Committed
    Django-->>Browser: COMPLETE with File
    Browser->>Django: GET status if response lost
    Django-->>Browser: Same saved File
